# Constants and Routes

## Copy and literals

Never hardcode string/number literals for product UI (copy, labels, regex, dimensions, query keys, etc.) in `.tsx` files. Define them in `src/lib/constants/*.ts` and import via `@/lib/constants`.

## Routes

Never hardcode in-app URL paths in components. Use `src/lib/constants/routes.ts` (`ROUTES`) and route helpers.

## Assets

Never hardcode public asset paths. Import from `src/lib/constants/assets.ts` (`PUBLIC_ASSETS`, etc.).

## Example

```typescript
// ❌ BAD — in a component
<Link href="/consultation">Get Free Consultation</Link>

// ✅ GOOD
import { ROUTES } from "@/lib/constants";
import { HOME_HERO } from "@/lib/constants/home";
<Link href={ROUTES.consultation}>{HOME_HERO.primaryCta}</Link>
```
